in the preaching mission, and later played an important part in the crusade before becoming bishop of Carcassonne; Peter accompanied his uncle to the south on several occasions, so meeting many of those involved in the crusade. The Historia thus contains a wealth of first-hand detail about the personalities and events of the crusade, and contemporary warfare in general.\"--BOOK JACKET"},"notes":{"type":"/type/text","value":"\"First published 1998 ... reprinted in paperback 2000\"--T.p. verso.\n\nIncludes bibliographical references (p. xlvi) and indexes."},"identifiers":{"goodreads":["887970","3237145"],"librarything":["1717725"]},"title":"The history of the Albigensian crusade","subtitle":"Peter of les-Vaux-de-Cernay's Historia Albigensis","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL403536A","name":"Petrus Sarnensis"}],"publish_date":"2000","other_titles":["Peter of les-Vaux-de-Cernay's Historia Albigensis"],"publishers":["Boydell Press"],"isbn_10":["0851158072","0851156584"],"lc_classifications":["","BX4890 .P3813 1998","BX4890.P3813 1998"],"publish_places":["Woodbridge, Suffolk, UK","Rochester, NY"],"contributions":["Sibly, W. A.","Sibly, M. D."],"pagination":"xlvi, 338 p. :","source_records":["marc:marc_western_washington_univ/wwu_bibs.mrc_revrev.mrc:888155019:2542","bwb:9780851158075","marc:marc_loc_2016/BooksAll.2016.part26.utf8:76293071:1010","bwb:9780851156583","amazon:0851156584","promise:bwb_daily_pallets_2022-08-30","ia:historyofalbigen0000petr","marc:marc_columbia/Columbia-extract-20221130-005.mrc:192663957:1478","marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/20220215_037.bib.mrc:137252643:2251"],"work_titles":["Historia Albigensium."],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"lccn":["97049978"],"subjects":["Albigenses","Heresies, Christian -- France -- Languedoc (France) -- History -- Middle Ages, 600-1500"],"publish_country":"enk","by_statement":"translated by W.A. Sibly and M.D. Sibly.","oclc_numbers":["44851658","60184910","37993685"],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"local_id":